hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"124","[AI-translation] Apne baayein taraf [teen bar] halka thuke. [Bura khwab dekhe to kare]"
"125","[AI-translation] Shaitan se aur dekhe hue ke shar se Allah ki panah mange [teen bar]. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"126","[AI-translation] Use kisi se bayan na kare. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"127","[AI-translation] Jis karwat tha us se dusri karwat le. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"128","[AI-translation] Uthe aur chahe to namaz padhe. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
